flowchart LR
    ORG[organization.yaml] --> C[Discord Desired-State Compiler]
    OS[Installed OS surface manifests] --> C
    TB[team-bindings.yaml] --> C
    POL[policies.yaml] --> C

    C --> DES[Desired Discord State]
    CUR[Current Guild State] --> DIFF[Planner / Diff]
    DES --> DIFF
    DIFF --> BOOT[Discord Bootstrap Director]
    BOOT --> ROLES[Roles]
    BOOT --> CATS[Categories]
    BOOT --> CH[Channels]
    BOOT --> PERM[Permissions]
    BOOT --> BIND[Binding Registry]
    BIND --> HG[Hermes Gateway Routing]
    BOOT --> VERIFY[Verify]
    VERIFY --> DEMOTE[Demote Administrator]
